## POC CLI Commands

### Create a Run from a Project and Delivery Directory
```text
thot [-h servidor] [-p puerto] create run <project_directory> <delivery_directory>
```

### Check Status of a Run
```text
thot [-h servidor] [-p puerto] check status <run_id>
```

### Retrieve a Delivery Expedient by ID
```text
thot [-h servidor] [-p puerto] get delivery <delivery_id>
```

### Cancel a Run
```text
thot [-h servidor] [-p puerto] cancel run <run_id>
```

### Clean Up an Interrupted Delivery
```text
thot [-h servidor] [-p puerto] clean delivery <delivery_id>
```

Files are tested per delivery without roster matching and that later mapping uses individual test_result_id values.
